---
// A2P 10DLC consent block, carrier-reviewer pattern (per the JobNimbus /
// campaign verification requirements): TWO separate checkboxes, neither
// pre-checked, neither required, with the full disclosure language directly
// next to each box (not behind a link):
//   1. informational SMS about the request (sms_consent)
//   2. promotional/marketing SMS + email (marketing_optin)
// /api/lead.ts enforces box 1: leads who do not check it get SMS DND set in
// GoHighLevel, so automations reach them by call and email only.
// lang="es" renders the same disclosures in Spanish (same meaning, same
// STOP/HELP mechanics) for the /es/ page.
interface Props {
  /** dark = on navy card backgrounds */
  tone?: 'light' | 'dark';
  lang?: 'en' | 'es';
}
const { tone = 'light', lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const label = tone === 'dark' ? 'text-navy-100' : 'text-slate-600';
const link = tone === 'dark' ? 'text-navy-100 underline hover:text-white' : 'text-navy-700 underline hover:text-navy-900';
const box = 'mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 rounded-sm border-slate-400 accent-orange-500';
const es = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="mt-2 space-y-2.5">
  <label class:list={['flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-2.5 text-xs leading-relaxed', label]}>
    <input type="checkbox" name="sms_consent" value="yes" class={box} />
    <span>
      {es ? (
        <>
          Acepto recibir mensajes de texto SMS informativos de Smart Home Improvements
          relacionados con mi solicitud, incluyendo programación de citas y
          actualizaciones del servicio, al número que proporcioné. La frecuencia de
          mensajes varía. Pueden aplicar tarifas de mensajes y datos. Responda STOP
          para cancelar, HELP para ayuda. El consentimiento no es condición de compra.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          I agree to receive informational SMS text messages from Smart Home
          Improvements related to my request, including appointment scheduling and
          service updates, at the number I provided. Message frequency varies.
          Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.
          Consent is not a condition of purchase.
        </>
      )}
    </span>
  </label>
  <label class:list={['flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-2.5 text-xs leading-relaxed', label]}>
    <input type="checkbox" name="marketing_optin" value="yes" class={box} />
    <span>
      {es ? (
        <>
          Acepto recibir mensajes de texto SMS promocionales y de marketing de Smart
          Home Improvements, como ofertas y recordatorios. La frecuencia de mensajes
          varía. Pueden aplicar tarifas de mensajes y datos. Responda STOP para
          cancelar, HELP para ayuda. El consentimiento no es condición de compra.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          I agree to receive promotional and marketing SMS text messages from Smart
          Home Improvements, such as offers and reminders. Message
          frequency varies. Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out,
          HELP for help. Consent is not a condition of purchase.
        </>
      )}
    </span>
  </label>
  <p class:list={['text-[0.7rem] leading-relaxed', label]}>
    {es ? 'Consulte nuestra' : 'Please see our'}&nbsp;<a href="/privacy/" class={link}>{es ? 'Política de Privacidad' : 'Privacy Policy'}</a>&nbsp;{es ? 'y' : 'and'}&nbsp;<a
      href="/terms/"
      class={link}>{es ? 'Términos de Servicio' : 'Terms of Service'}</a>.
  </p>
</div>
